 *   Tone: Professional yet friendly.\n\n5.  **Final Polish:**\n    你好！我是 Spark 健康助手。👋\n\n    很高兴为您服务！无论是关于**日常养生、常见疾病预防、运动指导，还是饮食营养**方面的问题，都可以随时问我。\n\n    请告诉我您想了解什么，我会为您提供准确、实用的建议。😊\n\n6.  **Review against Safety Guidelines:** No sensitive or harmful content. Just a standard greeting.\n\n7.  **Final Output Generation** (matching the drafted polish).","reasoning_duration_ms":3624,"reasoning_expanded":false,"reasoning_visibility":"full"}]}
